        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 400, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between', background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 12, padding: 26 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>院级优秀学生</Text>
                    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>“具有较好的身体素质，积极参加体育锻炼，参评学年体质健康测试成绩合格。”</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>另需：成绩专业前 30%、综测班级前 20%、第二课堂每学期 20 学分</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#94A3B8' }}>学生手册 · 第 149 页</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 380, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between', background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 12, padding: 26 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>院级优秀学生干部</Text>
                    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>“具有较好的身体素质，积极参加体育锻炼，参评学年体质健康测试成绩合格。”</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>班级干部每班 2 名，系、院学生干部按参评人数 30%</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#94A3B8' }}>学生手册 · 第 150 页</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 340, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between', background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 12, padding: 26 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>学院奖学金</Text>
                    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>“积极参加体育锻炼，《国家学生体质健康标准》测试成绩合格。”</Text>
                </Box>
